    "title": "An elevator, a brick wall and a bathroom: scientists use gravity to send ‘practically unblockable’ message",
    "summary": "Australian physicists used gravity to send the word \"gravity\" in binary code through a brick wall, in a proof-of-concept experiment built around a slow 1950s elevator. The method is described as practically unblockable because walls cannot shield against gravitational pull.",
